1
00:00:03,184 --> 00:00:07,495
Open Tools, Deployments, Plans, and click Add Deployment Plan.

2
00:00:07,495 --> 00:00:09,714
Name it Contact Center setup.

3
00:00:11,962 --> 00:00:13,306
Click Add Step.

4
00:00:13,306 --> 00:00:16,507
The Contact Center steps are listed by name:

5
00:00:16,507 --> 00:00:23,100
Contact Center Queue Groups, Contact Center Queues, Contact Center Voice Media Library, and more.

6
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:26,172
Each step exports every entry of its kind.

7
00:00:26,624 --> 00:00:33,046
Add Contact Center Queue Groups, Contact Center Queues and Contact Center Voice Media Library.

8
00:00:33,046 --> 00:00:36,514
Then click Execute and choose the file download.

